The typefaces in this folder are the ones the bundled Excalidraw editor draws
with. They are the same files that ship inside assets/excalidraw/excalidraw_host.zip,
converted from WOFF2 to TrueType so that Flutter can render a drawing preview in
the same hand it is drawn in.

Source: https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw (packages/excalidraw/fonts)

